# Trivy findings the release and scheduled scans accept, one CVE ID per line.
#
# Both scans fail on any HIGH or CRITICAL vulnerability, fixed upstream or not.
# An entry here is the only exception, and every entry must have, on the lines
# above it, why the finding does not apply or cannot be fixed yet, and on its
# own line an expiry date that Trivy enforces, after which the finding fails
# the scan again:
#
#   # Only reachable through <feature>, which the exporter never calls.
#   CVE-2026-00000 exp:2026-12-31
#
# There are no entries.
